mi with MR.\n\n\u2022 Method of operation\nFor hand tracking only.\nThere is no move operation.\nBasically, the scenario progresses by touching objects.\nOnce the battle simulation starts, it will be a gesture operation.\n1.Attack - Either hand is a Paper\nFrom the palm of your hand, the spell of Shikigami comes out.\nPlease hit enemies and items.\n2.Defense - Either hand is a Rock\nA shield will appear to prevent enemy attacks.\nIf an enemy attack approaches, use a shield to prevent it.\n\n\u2022 How to proceed with the game\n1.Start\nOnce booted, system navigation will begin.\nTouch the Start-device to start.\n2.GamePlay\nIf you select Shikigami, the battle simulation will start after a while.", "short_description": "Pass-through MR shooting game.\nWelcome to Simulation X.\nPlease experience the power of Shikigami with MR."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "SXDemo_CA_Y.png", "id": "1644986796362767", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262742_1644986803029433_7821931362292979087_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7V7EnMDhSrEQ7kNvwEDJPTN&_nc_oc=Adna5yhEPyshbEqQuC_KkhK7wa-Kvapsh5-gk2AL4-_eShuvrCkwiWYuT33H3Md83-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwghQVUBR2sqWIrrUUBE6rGleSrypcRK2grD3fSrtheqg&oe=69BAAF41"}, {"file_name": "SXDemo_CA_T.png", "id": "1101604795030391", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974767_1101604798363724_4760117289596456892_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oZQEhLLV9sIQ7kNvwGyaq4_&_nc_oc=AdkW1ekzk5NGfQOWAZz9o3GQZcLGYu3ieOHajrnwrchjqo5aas97zJDmRP3JJ92c3JA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx6x7r-AU4qeNAWuKLIiTBNHQWaEbkR8_vdhm7zAFCuvg&oe=69BAA9BA"}, {"file_name": "SXtrial_Logo2_App.png", "id": "1089068895282929", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035349_108906890